  \caption{Estimated effects of prior censorship experience. For each
    outcome, we estimate the GPI results from LLaMA3 with 8 billion
    parameters (green) and Gemma3 with 1 billion parameters (red)
    using the full sample (Full) and the matched sample (Matched).
    We compare GPI estimates with those of the text matching approach used in the original analysis (purple).
    The interval bars represent 95\% confidence intervals
