    % \texttt{R >> nppoints}    & $1.28\times 10^{-05}$ & $1.30\times 10^{-05}$ & $6.11\times 10^{-05}$ & $1.17\times 10^{-04}$ & $4.01\times 10^{-04}$ \\
    \texttt{R >> pypoints} & 8.3 & 36 & $ 2.1 \cdot 10^{2}$ & $ 2.1 \cdot 10^{3}$ & $ 2.2 \cdot 10^{4}$ \\
