\noindent
However, ganja's graphs are not merely stills, but can be animated and are interactive. 
Porting these even more advanced ganja features to \kingdon{} requires a synchronized state of \kingdon{}'s Python multivectors with ganja's javascript multivectors.
This shared state was achieved by creating a widget using the excellent anywidget package \cite{manz2024anywidget,manz2024notebooks}.
The resulting \texttt{GraphWidget} allows users to have a fully interactive ganja experience from within jupyter notebooks, as shown in \cref{fig:teahouse}.
\\\\
