\subsubsection{RQ3.2: Effectiveness of CoT}
We adopt CoT based on Vanilla LLMs to guide LLMs in providing their thinking process before generating patches. We compare CoT with another popular reasoning strategy, Tree of Thought (ToT), and Vanilla LLMs.
