    Normalized histogram $D_t(x)$ of the rescaled Pauli string coefficients $x=O_I/\max_I|O_I|$ as a function of time $t$, computed for $\theta_x=0.1\pi$ with truncation threshold $\epsilon_0=10^{-6}$. The sharp cutoff at $|x|\leq\epsilon_0$ reflects the applied truncation. }
