\noindent \textbf{RQ~2.2}: \emph{How to verify and validate that specified human values and ethical considerations are embedded during system runtime?}\vspace{0.25em} %validation / case studies etc / 

This research question complements RQ~2.1 as it aims to verify and validate~\cite{noauthor_ieee_2017} the resulting human value integrated requirements and implementations.
This ensures that human values and privacy are followed not just throughout the design phase, but also during runtime.

