    \label{fig:sup:rev_low_msl}
\end{figure}


We provide additional spectral results to supplement those the main paper, showing 10 representative variables: z500, z850, q700, q925, t850, t300, u850, 2t, 10u and msl (\cref{fig:sup:spectra1} and \cref{fig:sup:spectra2}).


